<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Wedding Invitation</title>
  <style>
    body {
      background: #fff8ed;
      color: #7b2020;
      font-family: Georgia, serif;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 30px 15px;
    }
    .card {
      max-width: 500px;
      margin: auto;
      padding: 25px;
      border: 3px double #c49a36;
      border-radius: 16px;
      background: white;
    }
    h1 { color: #a52626; }
    a {
      display: inline-block;
      background: #a52626;
      color: white;
      padding: 14px 22px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      text-decoration: none;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="card">
    <h1>💐 Wedding Invitation 💐</h1>
    <p>With the blessings of God and our families</p>
    <h2>K. Pavani Reddy</h2>
    <p>with</p>
    <h2>K. Renu Prasad</h2>
    <hr>
    <h3>Reception</h3>
    <p>25 November 2026 | 7 PM – 9 PM</p>
    <h3>Wedding Muhurtham</h3>
    <p>26 November 2026 | 4:30 AM – 5:30 AM</p>
    <p>ACJ Palace, Puttur, Andhra Pradesh</p>
    <p>We warmly invite you to celebrate with us.</p>

